# llm-orchestrator - environment template
#
# Copy for local development:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored. Never commit real credentials, and never put secrets in
# this template.
#
# Phase 1 (package foundation) requires NO environment variables.
#
# Provider credentials (for example, API keys for Gemini and Groq) will be
# documented here when the corresponding provider adapters are implemented in a
# later phase. Adding them now would imply that providers exist when they do not.
